WEBVTT

00:00:03.201 --> 00:00:04.820
Open Tools, Recipes.

00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:09.365
Every recipe has a name, tags and a description of what it creates.

00:00:09.365 --> 00:00:14.596
The CrestApps Recipes feature adds the descriptions, so you know what a recipe

00:00:14.596 --> 00:00:16.401
does before you run it.

00:00:16.852 --> 00:00:21.199
Type in the search box to find a recipe by name or tag.

00:00:21.199 --> 00:00:23.622
Here, the recipes about SQL.

00:00:24.074 --> 00:00:25.676
Click Run, and confirm.

00:00:25.676 --> 00:00:29.766
A recipe changes the site, so read the description first, and try it

00:00:29.766 --> 00:00:32.529
on a copy of the site when you are not sure.

00:00:32.529 --> 00:00:35.734
The page reports the result when the recipe is done.

